<package name="a2a-serve" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Serve a coding agent over A2A from its project directory</title>
  <description>Turn opencode, Claude Code, or any ACP coding agent into a sandboxed A2A
agent that people, messengers, and other agents can call. Run one agent
per project directory, with Docker sandboxing, pairing-code identities,
Tailscale and relay networking, Telegram/Discord/email messengers, voice,
schedules, backups, and recipes.</description>
  <url>https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-serve</url>
</package>
